---
import { BrainCircuit, Database, Laptop, Unplug } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section class="section" id="local-first">
  <div class="container local-layout">
    <div>
      <span class="section-label">Local-first operation</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Your Investigation. Your Environment.</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">MANTIS runs as a locally hosted application and stores core investigation artifacts in local databases and files. When you enable external intelligence or AI providers, relevant queries and context are sent to those configured services.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><Laptop size={17} /> Locally hosted web application</li>
        <li><Database size={17} /> Local investigation data and generated artifacts</li>
        <li><Unplug size={17} /> Optional external intelligence integrations</li>
        <li><BrainCircuit size={17} /> Local or external AI configurations where supported</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="architecture" aria-label="MANTIS architecture: analyst browser connects to a local MANTIS application, which stores local data and optionally communicates with configured intelligence and AI services">
      <span class="arch-label">Local environment</span>
      <div class="arch-node primary"><small>Analyst browser</small><strong>MANTIS Workspace</strong></div>
      <div class="connector"></div>
      <div class="arch-row">
        <div class="arch-node"><small>On this host</small><strong>Local data</strong></div>
        <div class="arch-node"><small>When enabled</small><strong>External APIs</strong></div>
      </div>
      <p>External communication occurs only for configured provider lookups, collection tools, or AI services—not every MANTIS workflow is offline.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .local-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .9fr; gap: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 8rem); align-items: center; }
  ul { display: grid; gap: .7rem; margin: 2rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; color: #b5b5b5; font-size: .86rem; }
  li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; }
  li :global(svg) { color: var(--yellow); }
  .architecture { position: relative; padding: 3.2rem 2rem 2rem; background: #111; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 1rem; }
  .arch-label { position: absolute; top: 1rem; left: 1rem; color: #696969; font: .62rem/1 var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .arch-node { padding: 1.15rem; background: #171717; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: .7rem; }
  .arch-node.primary { border-color: rgba(255,229,0,.38); box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--yellow); }
  .arch-node small { display: block; margin-bottom: .4rem; color: #6e6e6e; font: .58rem/1 var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .arch-node strong { font-size: .9rem; }
  .connector { width: 1px; height: 38px; margin: 0 auto; background: #444; }
  .arch-row { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .7rem; }
  .arch-row::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: -18px; left: 25%; right: 25%; height: 1px; background: #444; }
  .architecture > p { margin: 1.2rem 0 0; color: #777; font-size: .7rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .local-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 430px) { .architecture { padding-inline: 1rem; } .arch-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .arch-row::before { display: none; } }
</style>
